lunduke-city (0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of Lunduke City 0.2 for LCOS.
  * gtkmm 3 shell: tiles, sprites, budget, map overlays, PulseAudio sounds.
  * Ships NOTICE (GPL-3+ and EA additional terms) and COPYING under
    /usr/share/doc/lunduke-city/.
  * Vendored Micropolis engine + assets under /usr/share/lunduke-city/.

